/*
:name: spec_calls_splice_mix_entry
:type: error
:error: mix|named and unnamed|unnamed and named|unnamed and a named|named and an unnamed
*/

// qa.md Appendix §8: "the all-named/all-unnamed rule ... Mixing a named and an
// unnamed splice is an error."
// docs 03-bundle.md: `const mix2 = (...p, const e=5)  // error: the result
// mixes unnamed and named entries`.

const p = (1, 2)
const mix2 = (...p, const e=5) // locate_error_here
cassert(mix2.e == 5)
